      "pathLabel": "Our Breakfast Menu",
      "image": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/Global/Breakfastf\u0026btab.jpg",
      "description": "\u003cp style\u003d\"font-family: \u0026quot;PI Sans\u0026quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003eOur full Premier Inn Breakfast includes freshly-cooked bacon, sausages, eggs cooked your way, hash browns, beans and black pudding, for a great start to your day. If you fancy something a bit lighter, try our tasty Continental Breakfast instead, with fruit, cereal and freshly-baked pastries (Premier Inn Breakfasts include the full selection from the Continental Breakfast).\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n",
      "disclaimer": ""
    }, {
      "name": "Dinner",
      "path": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/THY/Thyme-Full-Menu.pdf",
      "pathLabel": "Our Dinner Menu",
      "image": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/THY/Thyme-Main-Curry.jpg",
      "description": "\u003cp style\u003d\"font-family: \u0026quot;PI Sans\u0026quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003eFrom gourmet burgers and steaks to our salads and delicious desserts, our dishes are freshly prepared using quality ingredients from hand-picked suppliers. Plus, with our Meal Deal enjoy a tasty 2-course dinner from the evening menu, and after a good night’s sleep you can look forward to a delicious breakfast just how you like it!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style\u003d\"font-family: \u0026quot;PI Sans\u0026quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"micro\"\u003e*Any two courses from our evening menu.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n",
      "disclaimer": "Some dishes on our menu are not available at all sites."
    }, {
      "name": "Kids",
      "path": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/THY/Kids-Menu.pdf",
      "pathLabel": "Our Kids Menu",
      "image": "/content/dam/pi/websites/desktop/new-hotel-details-content/restaurants/Kids-Dinner.jpg",
      "description": "\u003cp\u003eOur kids menu has tasty and healthy treats even the fussiest little monsters will love. We’ve got all their favourites, from steak and chips to grilled chicken breast. All of our main meals include at least 1 of your kids 5 a day. Plus, up to 2 kids eat breakfast free!*\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n",
      "disclaimer": "*up to two under 16s eat breakfast free when one adult orders a full Premier Inn Breakfast or Meal Deal"
